        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you for playing this game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow plants under your computer screen, manage a beautiful garden with a cute fox, or simply enjoy watching them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the beautiful weather system and the changing time, from day to night, from clear skies to cloudy days, rain, or sudden lightning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras/f9e9a4ade0ea0628716160310a08a792.avif?t=1761353336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras_big/f9e9a4ade0ea0628716160310a08a792.webp?t=1761353336 width=1560 height=877 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras/ed2a002d998c1f8e82aa663cac3eb5fa.avif?t=1761353336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras_big/ed2a002d998c1f8e82aa663cac3eb5fa.avif?t=1761353336 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flowers you grow aren't just for show; you can also sell them to earn money, which you can use to upgrade your tools and get magical stars!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras/d114bcc5b39e48c47baef56953e2f310.avif?t=1761353336\" width=1560 height=824 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considering you might not want the game to interfere with your computer usage, we've added a special &quot;pass-through area&quot; to this game. When you enable this mode, any area around your mouse becomes transparent! You can also adjust the size of this area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you for playing this game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow plants under your computer screen, manage a beautiful garden with a cute fox, or simply enjoy watching them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the beautiful weather system and the changing time, from day to night, from clear skies to cloudy days, rain, or sudden lightning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras/f9e9a4ade0ea0628716160310a08a792.avif?t=1761353336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras_big/f9e9a4ade0ea0628716160310a08a792.webp?t=1761353336 width=1560 height=877 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras/ed2a002d998c1f8e82aa663cac3eb5fa.avif?t=1761353336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras_big/ed2a002d998c1f8e82aa663cac3eb5fa.avif?t=1761353336 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flowers you grow aren't just for show; you can also sell them to earn money, which you can use to upgrade your tools and get magical stars!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941760/extras/d114bcc5b39e48c47baef56953e2f310.avif?t=1761353336\" width=1560 height=824 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considering you might not want the game to interfere with your computer usage, we've added a special &quot;pass-through area&quot; to this game. When you enable this mode, any area around your mouse becomes transparent! You can also adjust the size of this area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
